d on the rate, from `P(E_bip) ≤` product","+bound), `c′/4` (an upper bound, from one fixed bipartition) and the","+thinning route `c′/2 − ln 2 + ln 2 · ln(2 ln 2/c′)` — and the LDP rate","+`I_{c′}(½)` for `E_relax` quoted in §1.4 (`rate_check.py`).","+","+| `c′` | `−log P_bip/N` at `N = 20` | at 60 | at 120 | linear fit, bip, `N ≥ 60` | log-fit, bip, `N ≥ 40` | `−log P_rel/N` at 400 | linear fit, rel, `N ≥ 200` | log-fit, rel, `N ≥ 100` | `c′/4 − ln 2` | `c′/4` | thinning | **LDP `I(½)`** |","+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|","+| 2 | 0.107 | 0.060 | 0.049 | 0.0383 | 0.0392 | 0.0414 | 0.0380 | 0.0375 | 0 | 0.500 | 0.053 | **0.0362** |","+| 3 | 0.308 | 0.221 | 0.202 | 0.1825 | 0.1864 | 0.1896 | 0.1846 | 0.1853 | 0.057 | 0.750 | 0.272 | **0.1831** |","+| 4 | 0.571 | 0.436 | 0.407 | 0.3767 | 0.3818 | 0.3877 | 0.3799 | 0.3812 | 0.307 | 1.000 | 0.572 | **0.3796** |","+| 5 | 0.877 | 0.682 | 0.639 | 0.5955 | 0.6013 | 0.6107 | 0.5991 | 0.6005 | 0.557 | 1.250 | 0.918 | **0.5997** |","+| 6.6 | 1.432 | 1.110 | 1.040 | 0.9704 | 0.9793 | 0.9938 | 0.9744 | 0.9759 | 0.957 | 1.650 | 1.525 | **0.9756** |","+| 8 | 1.983 | 1.504 | 1.407 | 1.3097 | 1.3256 | 1.3421 | 1.3148 | 1.3163 | 1.307 | 2.000 | 2.092 | **1.3161** |","+| 10 | 2.894 | 2.091 | 1.945 | 1.7995 | 1.8358 | 1.8496 | 1.8091 | 1.8115 | 1.807 | 2.500 | 2.937 | **1.8102** |","+","+(`rates.csv`, `rate_fits.csv`; standard errors of the linear slopes","+`0.0001–0.0025`, meaningless as uncertainty since the residual is the","+`log N` term, not noise.) Figure: `rates.png`, `−log P/N` against `N` per","+`c′` with the bracket shaded, the LDP rate dashed.","+","+**What the table says.**","+","+1. **The exact computation reproduces the quoted large-deviation rate.**","+   The log-corrected fit of `E_relax` over `N = 100–400` agrees with","+   `I_{c′}(½)` to `0.0003–0.002` at every `c′`, and the linear fit over","+   `N ≥ 200` to `0.001–0.002`. Item 01 could check the quoted formula only","+   at its zero and its s